      "explanation": "Moderate pipeline-aware relaxation: reduce orders when pipeline is high relative to recent demand, but boost if backlog is large. Node0: if backlog>20 and pipeline<60, add 2; if pipeline>60 and backlog<10, subtract 2. Node1: if backlog>10 and pipeline<80, add 1; if pipeline>80 and backlog<5, subtract 1. Node2: if backlog>10 and pipeline<80, add 1; if pipeline>80 and backlog<5, subtract 1.",
      "rules": [
