      "explanation": "Backlog-focused: prioritize clearing backlog by increasing orders when backlog is high, but avoid over-ordering when pipeline is already large. Node0: if backlog>25, add 3; if backlog>15 and pipeline<50, add 1. Node1: if backlog>15, add 2; if backlog>5 and pipeline<60, add 1. Node2: if backlog>15, add 2; if backlog>5 and pipeline<60, add 1.",
